# The trust list of Patient Partridge: the certificates a signature may lead to for the
# reader to call its signer trusted. The reader reads this file when it is built.
#
# This version ships NO certificates. With an empty list no signer is ever called trusted:
# a signature that holds is shown as "Signature intact; signer not verified".
#
# To put a certificate on the list, add it here as a PEM block (a line with five dashes, BEGIN
# CERTIFICATE, five dashes; the base64 text; the matching END line). Each certificate on the
# list is trusted as it stands, so the list is a decision, not a convenience.
# See the section about signatures in README.md.
